        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises AS-25 Traditional Crane Neck Decorative Floor Mount Door Stop </b>\r\n<p>\r\nConstructed of solid brass, this Crane Neck Door Stop adds a touch of sophistication to any room.  It is equally suited for use in private residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\nThe floor mount design provides excellent protection for your walls and door hardware. Packaged with mounting  screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-for-ls-25-as-25-door-stop-field-enterprises-ls-25-rubber\"><b>Replacement Rubber Tip</b></a> and other Field Enterprises <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Field Enterprises Decorative Door Stops\"><b>Decorative Door Stops</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of Field Enterprises FEI-AS-25 Traditional Crane Neck Decorative Floor Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Diameter:  2\"</li>\r\n<li>Floor to Bumper Height:  1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Height:  2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper: 3/4\" Diameter, Black Rubbed</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass </li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hardware:  #4 x 1\" screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
